OL,3,GNEWSASinn Fein ministers' no-confidence
OL,4,Adebate under way
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Assembly has
OL,7,Fstarted debating no-confidence motions
OL,8,Fin Stormont's first minister Michelle
OL,9,FO'Neill and three other Sinn Fein
OL,10,Fministers over their handling of the
OL,11,FDrumcree parading dispute.
OL,13,FThe motion against Michelle O'Neill and
OL,14,Fthree other Sinn Fein ministers
OL,15,Freceived the backing of unionist
OL,16,Fparties last week.
OL,18,FHowever, the attempt to oust them will
OL,19,Ffail as it requires cross-community
OL,20,Fsupport from a majority of both
OL,21,Funionists and nationalists in the
OL,22,Fassembly.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
